message: "If you use this technical tutorial or software, cite the archived release associated with the repository record."
title: "From qualitative observations to quantitative data: a transition guide for experimental scientists"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Montefusco-Pereira"
    given-names: "Carlos Victor"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-10"
repository-code: "https://github.com/camontefusco/legacy-bioimage-audit"
abstract: >-
  Transition guide and computational demonstration for experimental scientists
  learning to convert qualitative microscopy observations into operational
  measurements, structured datasets, quality control, and defensible claims.
  A legacy-analysis reconstruction is retained as a cautionary case.
keywords:
  - bioimage analysis
  - data science education
  - quantitative microscopy
  - reproducibility
  - microscopy
